{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"105945","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/105945","key":"MC-249172","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"16/Mar/22 5:47 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>The map color for mangrove slabs is incorrect. Unlike mangrove planks, which appear red on a map, mangrove slabs appear brown on a map. This behavior is inconsistent with the behavior of other types of wood, which use the same color on maps for both their slabs and their planks.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Obtain and fill a map</li>\n\t<li>Place oak slabs and planks<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The slabs and planks appear brown on the map</li>\n\t<li>Place mangrove slabs and planks<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The planks appear red, but the slabs appear brown on the map</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehavior\"></a>Expected behavior</h3>\n<p>The mangrove slab color would be red, like the map color of mangrove planks.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualbehavior\"></a>Actual behavior</h3>\n<p>The mangrove slab color is brown, like the map color of oak planks and slabs.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Mar/22 2:11 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/138864","id":"138864","filename":"2022-03-16_20.44.59.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.